        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed Rally – Classic Arcade Racing, Reimagined!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Rally</strong> is a fast-paced, retro-inspired top-down racer that rekindles the spirit of the golden age of arcade driving. Drawing inspiration from <strong>ATARI and C64 classics like <i>Rally Speedway</i> and the <i>Micro Machines</i> series of the 8-bit and 16-bit era</strong>, it captures the essence of simple yet thrilling pick-up-and-play racing — tight handling, instant action, and that “just one more race” feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re chasing online high scores or battling friends in local multiplayer, <strong>Speed Rally</strong> delivers a modern tribute to those timeless mechanics — easy to learn, hard to master, and endlessly replayable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Across Diverse Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on a variety of tracks set in <strong>woodlands, deserts, and tropical islands</strong>. Choose from different car models and put your skills to the test in <strong>CPU races</strong> or <strong>time trial mode</strong>, where every millisecond counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a friend in <strong>local multiplayer</strong> with two exciting modes. Play in <strong>split-screen</strong> or crank up the intensity with <strong>Penalty Mode</strong>, where both players race on the same screen—fall too far behind, and you're out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the Leaderboards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to master every track and push for the fastest lap times. Can you claim the top spot and become the ultimate Speed Rally champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in and start racing today!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed Rally – Classic Arcade Racing, Reimagined!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Rally</strong> is a fast-paced, retro-inspired top-down racer that rekindles the spirit of the golden age of arcade driving. Drawing inspiration from <strong>ATARI and C64 classics like <i>Rally Speedway</i> and the <i>Micro Machines</i> series of the 8-bit and 16-bit era</strong>, it captures the essence of simple yet thrilling pick-up-and-play racing — tight handling, instant action, and that “just one more race” feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re chasing online high scores or battling friends in local multiplayer, <strong>Speed Rally</strong> delivers a modern tribute to those timeless mechanics — easy to learn, hard to master, and endlessly replayable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Across Diverse Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on a variety of tracks set in <strong>woodlands, deserts, and tropical islands</strong>. Choose from different car models and put your skills to the test in <strong>CPU races</strong> or <strong>time trial mode</strong>, where every millisecond counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a friend in <strong>local multiplayer</strong> with two exciting modes. Play in <strong>split-screen</strong> or crank up the intensity with <strong>Penalty Mode</strong>, where both players race on the same screen—fall too far behind, and you're out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the Leaderboards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to master every track and push for the fastest lap times. Can you claim the top spot and become the ultimate Speed Rally champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in and start racing today!</p>",
        "short_description": "Try Speed Rally, the retro-inspired top-down arcade racer! Chase online high scores or battle friends in local multiplayer — a throwback to the golden era of single-button arcade fun.",
